sed on is doing in the books I  mean not likely anyways we know that  Lady Stoneheart got cut from the show  and since the Brotherhood sold him off  it isn't likely that he'll be joining  back up with them anytime soon he is the  last you know remaining person that we  know that has you know Roberts Ludd but  do we really think with so few episodes  left that the show will have some houses  rally around him and the Stormlands and  go against the crown me it's possible it  just seems like it might be unnecessary  at this point since we're headed towards  the war for the dawn think what makes  the most sense is that since Arya is  back in Westeros we will see them meet  up again let's not forget that  Melisandre has headed south now that Jon  sent her away so a confluence of these  three characters might be in the works  after all Melisandre told Arya that they  would meet again and in the show story  Gendry is most important for these two  characters if he's going to play a major  role is yet to be seen but D&amp;D no fans  want to see Kendrick come back and a  reunion with Daario would be a good  payoff so he could play a role or it  could just be fanservice to tie up that  loose end and they could maybe just get  together and that'd be it I won't go too  far into predictions for Arya Melisandre  since I'll be doing that in a different  video but at least now we know that the  rower that was promised is going to make  an appearance let me know what part you  guys think and reply in season 7 or what  you'd like to see between these three  characters before I go I wanted to give  a shout out to a new channel that is  doing some cool stuff for charity it's  called trial by trivia and they've been  doing Game of Thrones tribute which is  actually a lot of fun I came across  their channel the Saturday night and had  a blast answering questions in the chat  room  there are other subscribers they've also  been doing a tournament where YouTube  creators that you probably kn